  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Modernizacin del Abastecimiento de Agua</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Supply Modernization Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del prstamo sera mejorar la eficiencia y la calidad de los servicios de agua potable en Surinam (Gran Paramaribo y reas costeras). Los objetivos especficos seran: (i) consolidacin de la reduccin del agua no-contabilizada; (ii) mejoramiento y rehabilitacin de la infraestructura hdrica; (iii); mejoras de eficiencia energtica; y (iv) fortalecimiento del operador (SWM).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the proposed operation is to improve efficiency, quality, and financial and environmental sustainability of the potable water services provided by SWM. The specific objectives are: (i) Reduction of NRW levels in the Central and Western Regions through the implementation of critical aspects of the 2015 NRW reduction strategy; (ii) Increase availability of water supply services in critical areas of Suriname through upgrading water production infrastructure; (iii) Modernize the operations and management of SWM through the implementation of key recommendations of the Institutional Strengthening Plan and the development of a water supply strategy for the Interior.</narrative>
  </description>
